<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβο-άω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βοήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					286
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βώσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.85
				</span></i>
			: strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοάω</span>:—<i>bawl</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μόνον βοᾶν, ἀλλ᾽ ἤδη καὶ καταβοᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.475
				</span></i>
			: but usu. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			gen., <i>cry out, inveigh against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὸς περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τινῶν ὅτι σπονδὰς λελυκότες εἶεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.67
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.45
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>have clamour raised against one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>shout down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				711
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				286
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> c. acc.
			cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά μοι βόασον . . ὄπα τοῖς
				Ἀτρείδαις</span>
			<i>carry down</i> my voice . . , <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1067
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>call for help</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					16.551.2
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				42.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: c. gen. et inf., <i>demand
				clamorously from . . </i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τινὸς κολάζειν τὸν στρατιώτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					2.12.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be loudly entreated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				4J.
			</span></i></div>
